      "sourceTextSha256": "fd3f01be6319d6db05a93e5cef430ef140d7dc95907edf3a24e4291dcea66273",
      "text": "The two-day crossing continues. The ship crosses the Antarctic Convergence, where cold northward-flowing waters meet warmer subantarctic waters. The marine life and mix of seabirds change as you cross. You can watch from the ship.",
